          "entities": {},
          "text": "I'll explain how to use Fable 5 and GPT 5.6 Sol for the highest performance (delulu edition)\n\nYou guys know that Claude and GPT model hate each other deep down? That's why there was a prompt like \"ChatGPT said you can't do this\" then Claude somehow performed better\n\nSo, you give the task to Fable and ask it to spawn GPT 5.6 Sol with the same task; both will draft a plan, then simply ask each model to review the other's and find the flaws\n\nMake them keep doing it until both agree that the plan work, the thing is, you instructed that you will use the plan of the one who's better, then you ask the winning model to execute the plan and use the other model (who doesn't like the plan in the first place because it lost) to be the one to review and find the flaws again\n\nKeep it in the loop until done, and you review it\n\nThis is the win-win situation because you get the best result verified by both models, and you get to see both models fight each other like a tsundere love interest, but you can also view it through the lens of yuri and yaoi as well\n\nYou kill two birds with one stone, and I'm watching it fight while typing this"
